      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOT WRITTEN OFF (2) returns from a let-up and makes plenty of appeal over her pet track and trip. Demolished a similar field last start over 1000m here with the 57kg on July 17. Fitted with a sharp 800m trial win and gets the gun run. Hard to beat in this suitable race. SHAGGY (1) frustrating gelding quickly running out of chances. Showed plenty of fight with the 59kg when second over 1000m at Taree on the good surface. Can get cover from the draw and take a hand in the finish. KING POTTER (7) lightly raced gelding resuming after making good progress last prep. Primed with the two searching 1000m trials and has the upside to test this field. CRESTA RUN (5) is mixing her form but brings the right ratings to play a role. Key jockey change and stays in the mix.",
